WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:03.840
Beautiful.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:04.670
So beautiful.

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:09.520
It's easy to cook on TV.

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:11.750
There's talented producers,
there's editors,

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:14.660
and there's all sorts of
things that make you look good.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:17.320
You know, before any TV came
anywhere near my career,

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:19.140
I'd mastered my craft.

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:21.870
You'll see a side to
me across this class

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:26.600
that I don't think has
ever been shown before.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.008
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:32.009
Knife skills.

00:00:32.009 --> 00:00:33.440
The basics are so important.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:36.230
Three fingers down, and
this beautiful knuckle

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:38.850
is the guiding light
across that knife.

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:39.550
Cooking salmon.

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:41.720
So the secret is
to score the skin.

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:43.405
That stops the fish
from buckling up.

00:00:43.405 --> 00:00:45.280
You can't pick up the
"World's Best Cookbook"

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:47.610
and understand it,
you need to do it.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:48.510
Mm.

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:49.260
Delicious.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:52.810
Everything that I've learned,
understood, stolen, perfected,

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:55.549
is laid bare across this MasterClass,
for the first time ever.

00:00:56.049 --> 00:00:59.590
And you would learn how to cook
those ingredients from start

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:00.630
to finish.

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:03.230
I've just spent
the last 30 years

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.164
busting my ass off to
get on the plate what

00:01:06.164 --> 00:01:07.080
I'm about to show you.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:11.700
And watch, but watch
carefully.

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:14.820
I'm Gordon Ramsay and
this is my MasterClass.

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:17.570
[MUSIC PLAYING]

